  "description": "It's time to get your kid on a scooter that's the perfect combination of safety, functionality and pure riding fun. Enter the Mongoose Force 3.0 Folding Scooter, a convenient morning ride that doubles as an exciting weekend get-around. This kick scooter folds up easily into a nice compact shape, perfect for storing in a locker or stowing in the trunk before the next family trip.\nFolds up for compact storage and transport with easy folding design, perfect for storing in a school locker or under a bus seat.\nFull-coverage MaxGrip™ on the alloy deck and steel brake combine with 142 mm wheels and durable ABEC-7 bearings.\nTool-free height adjustment has three different lock-in points to fit a wide range of riders.\nHeavy-duty steel frame supports children 8+ up to 220 lbs.\nPremium, durable bike-style grips and a bike-style kickstand help protect the handlebar and frame.",
